# Предложения
## Получить список всех предложений (только если авторизован)
GET http://localhost:4000/offers HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6InRvcmFifl1lfPEfenuv9wnU213m78FjoiSmVmcmV5IEVwc3RpbmUiLCJpZCI6IjY5ZGE2MTE0ODM5YjkwZTc3NGI4ZDZmMCIsImlhdCI6MTc3OwiZXhwIjoxNzc5Njk4NTEwfQ.mPNwXEulq1b54mdmb7nb3qo7EGyf-U-spbDtMzIh5HDBUs4
###


## Создать предложение
POST http://localhost:4000/offers HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ноев ковчег",
  "description":"Теплый и просторный дом на воде",
  "preview":"none",
  "price": 99999,
  "isPremium":true,
  "isFavorite":true,
  "rating":5,
  "type":"apartment",
  "authorId": "79cab3915b676cb07b52e135",
  "city":"Paris"
}

###

## Получить предложение по id
GET http://localhost:4000/offers/69da33e4bbece92e29 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

## Изменить предложение по id
PATCH  http://localhost:4000/offers/69da33e4bbece92e29 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "name": "Ужасное место для сна!",
}

###

## Удалить предложение
DELETE  http://localhost:4000/offers/69da33e4bbece92e29 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

## Добавить предложение в избранное
POST http://localhost:4000/offers/69da33e4bbece92e29/favorite HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6InRvcmFifl1lfPEfenuv9wnU213m78FjoiSmVmcmV5IEVwc3RpbmUiLCJpZCI6IjY5ZGE2MTE0ODM5YjkwZTc3NGI4ZDZmMCIsImlhdCI6MTc3OwiZXhwIjoxNzc5Njk4NTEwfQ.mPNwXEulq1b54mdmb7nb3qo7EGyf-U-spbDtMzIh5HDBUs4
###

## Получить избранные предложения
GET http://localhost:4000/offers/me/favorites HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6InRvcmFifl1lfPEfenuv9wnU213m78FjoiSmVmcmV5IEVwc3RpbmUiLCJpZCI6IjY5ZGE2MTE0ODM5YjkwZTc3NGI4ZDZmMCIsImlhdCI6MTc3OwiZXhwIjoxNzc5Njk4NTEwfQ.mPNwXEulq1b54mdmb7nb3qo7EGyf-U-spbDtMzIh5HDBUs4
###

## Удалить предложение из избранного
DELETE http://localhost:4000/offers/69da33e4bbece92e29/favorite HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6InRvcmFifl1lfPEfenuv9wnU213m78FjoiSmVmcmV5IEVwc3RpbmUiLCJpZCI6IjY5ZGE2MTE0ODM5YjkwZTc3NGI4ZDZmMCIsImlhdCI6MTc3OwiZXhwIjoxNzc5Njk4NTEwfQ.mPNwXEulq1b54mdmb7nb3qo7EGyf-U-spbDtMzIh5HDBUs4
###

### Загрузить превью для предложения
POST http://localhost:4000/offers/69da33e4bbece92e29/preview HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6InRvcmFifl1lfPEfenuv9wnU213m78FjoiSmVmcmV5IEVwc3RpbmUiLCJpZCI6IjY5ZGE2MTE0ODM5YjkwZTc3NGI4ZDZmMCIsImlhdCI6MTc3OwiZXhwIjoxNzc5Njk4NTEwfQ.mPNwXEulq1b54mdmb7nb3qo7EGyf-U-spbDtMzIh5HDBUs4
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundaryPreview

------WebKitFormBoundaryPreview
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="preview"; filename="preview.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../../../static/preview.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundaryPreview--

###

### Заменить все 6 изображений в предложении
POST http://localhost:4000/offers/69da33e4bbece92e29/images HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6InRvcmFifl1lfPEfenuv9wnU213m78FjoiSmVmcmV5IEVwc3RpbmUiLCJpZCI6IjY5ZGE2MTE0ODM5YjkwZTc3NGI4ZDZmMCIsImlhdCI6MTc3OwiZXhwIjoxNzc5Njk4NTEwfQ.mPNwXEulq1b54mdmb7nb3qo7EGyf-U-spbDtMzIh5HDBUs4
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundaryReplace

------WebKitFormBoundaryReplace
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="default_photo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../../../static/default-photo.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundaryReplace
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="new-room-1.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../../../static/default-photo.jpg
